    "updated_at": "2025-03-14T15:09:23Z",
    "body": "> wss://tracker.ghostchu-services.top/announce\n\nHi,\nI tested the wss protocol and it seems to work well with WebTorrents.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2729e29-76e8-4d42-96e2-1e4dd50a7760)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5251239-463e-4472-b67f-0645c677d8dd)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9da8dc33-fac7-4675-95ca-8f57062acf43)\n\nEdit: I've noticed that our Tracker may be too aggressive in recycling WSS connections, which may have something to do with WebSocket processing. I'll check that again later.",
